+    ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul 𝔬]
+  rw [integral_eq_lintegral_of_nonneg_ae <| .of_forall 𝓌 𝔭]
+  simpa using (integrable_weightedKernel_mul hα hf hz).norm.aestronglyMeasurable
